flowchart LR
    U[Business User] --> APP[Power Apps or SharePoint Form]
    APP --> PP[Power Automate Workflow]

    PP --> SC[Standard Connectors]
    SC --> M365[SharePoint / Teams / Outlook / Dataverse]

    PP --> CC[Custom Connector]
    CC --> API[Azure Function / REST API]
    API --> APIM[API Management - Optional]
    APIM --> LOB[ERP / Asset / CRM / HRIS / Service Desk]

    APP -. custom user experience .-> SPFX[SPFx React Command Center]
    PP -. complex enterprise integration .-> LA[Azure Logic Apps]

    ENTRA[Microsoft Entra ID / RBAC] --> APP
    ENTRA --> API
    GOV[DLP / Key Vault / Monitoring / ALM] --> PP
    GOV --> API
    GOV --> LA